  "evidence": "TEXT_E: eliminate the deficit and run a surplus; no rises in VAT/Income Tax/NI and raise thresholds; create 2 million more jobs and full employment; controlled immigration to the tens of thousands; at least £8bn extra for the NHS and a 7‑day service; build 200,000 Starter Homes and extend Help to Buy; hold an in‑out EU referendum by end‑2017. TEXT_C: replace austerity with spending increases; protect Scotland’s NHS with £2bn extra; raise the minimum wage; oppose Trident renewal; keep the UK in the EU and require a double‑majority; tailor immigration to Scotland’s needs.",
